	(text "CN6 = DSP board power (review A24 / P2-10): 5V_PVDD = U3 output BEFORE D5 (~5.0 V regulated),\nso D5 only carries the ESP32 side. Pins 1-2 +5V, pins 3-4 GND; XH keyed housing = polarity protection.\nBudget ~0.4 A typ / ~0.8 A max. DSP board: own bucks from this input (AP63203 3.3 V, 2x AP63201 1.2 V / 0.9 V,\nLDO 1.8 V), input bulk 47-100 uF + ceramics, soft-start. With USB-C only, CN6 is off: firmware keeps\nI2S / DSP_RESET / DSP_SELFBOOT low or hi-Z until PVDD is present (no back-powering through I/O pins)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e9d07cf3-bbaa-42bc-9208-0bdcb60f900f")
	)
)
